  "Makes all system fonts installed on the system available in the Font dropdowns. This function seems to cause Vortex to crash for a very small number of users and we have not been able to identify what sets the affected systems apart yet.": "讓系統上安裝的所有字型都能在字型下拉選單中選用。這項功能似乎會導致極少數使用者的 Vortex 當機，我們目前還無法確認受影響的系統有什麼特別之處。",
  "Every dashlet (the widgets on the Dashboards) has a height that is a multiple of this value and a width of either 1/3, 2/3 or 3/3 of the window width. Here you can adjust the base height of dashlets but we can't promise every dashlet will look good or even be usable with non-default height.": "每個儀表板元件（儀表板上的小工具）的高度都是這個值的倍數，寬度則為視窗寬度的 1/3、2/3 或 3/3。你可以在這裡調整元件的基準高度，但我們無法保證每個元件在非預設高度下都好看，甚至能否正常使用。"
